          "reviewerNote": "课程内容支持"
        },
        {
          "text": "**模糊查询（LIKE）**：当需要按部分信息匹配数据时使用，例如搜索姓名中包含某个字、以某字开头或符合特定长度模式的数据。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "直接支持"
        },
        {
          "text": "搭配 `%`（匹配任意多个字符）和 `_`（匹配单个字符）构造匹配规则，并用单引号包裹。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "直接支持"
        },
        {
          "text": "**排序查询（ORDER BY）**：当需要让结果按特定顺序展示时使用，例如按年龄升序（ASC）或降序（DESC）。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "直接支持"
        },
        {
          "text": "多字段排序时，先按第一个字段排，相同再按第二个字段排。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "直接支持"
        },
        {
          "text": "**分页查询（LIMIT）**：当数据量较大时，避免一次加载全部数据造成性能浪费，通过 `LIMIT 起始索引, 查询条数` 限制返回行数（索引从0开始）。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "直接支持"
        },
        {
          "text": "常用于列表分页显示。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "可推断支持"
        },
        {
          "text": "**执行顺序**：先 `WHERE` 筛选 → 再 `ORDER BY` 排序 → 最后 `LIMIT` 分页。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
