      "answerHash": "f354011bdb56c8eae0e825f29db6c55867a46d2a358db83e995010e77912d4c4",
      "evidenceCount": 1,
      "claims": [
        {
          "text": "根据课程内容，聚合函数（COUNT、MAX、MIN、SUM、AVG）主要用于对整表或分组数据进行统计计算，例如统计总条数、最大值、最小值、平均值和总和。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "证据直接支持"
        },
        {
          "text": "分组查询（GROUP BY）则能将相同字段的数据分为一组，再结合聚合函数实现分组统计（如按班级统计人数、按性别统计平均年龄）。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "证据直接支持"
        },
        {
          "text": "需要统计记录总数时，使用 `COUNT(*)` 或 `COUNT(字段)`。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "unsupported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [],
          "reviewerNote": "部分用法无证据"
        },
        {
          "text": "需要找出某个字段的最大/最小值时，使用 `MAX(字段)` / `MIN(字段)`。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "证据支持MAX和MIN"
        },
        {
          "text": "需要计算数值字段的总和或平均值时，使用 `SUM(字段)` / `AVG(字段)`。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "证据支持SUM和AVG"
        },
        {
          "text": "如果希望按某个维度（如班级、性别）分别统计，则在 `SELECT` 中同时包含分组字段和聚合函数，并加上 `GROUP BY` 分组字段。",
          "claimScope": "course",
          "supportReview": "supported",
          "correctnessReview": "not_applicable",
          "evidenceIndexes": [
            1
          ],
          "reviewerNote": "证据直接支持"
        },
        {
          "text": "若需对分组后的结果进一步筛选，可使用 `HAVING`（分组后筛选），而 `WHERE` 用于分组前筛选。",
          "claimScope": "course",
